# ==============================================================================
# ChatFiles .gitignore — 严格隐私保护
# 仓库只保留：代码框架 + replication 文档 + 配置文件
# 任何含有个人聊天/文件/数据的目录一律排除
# ==============================================================================

# ===== 个人数据（绝对不可泄露） =====
data/
archive/
work/
imports/
.uploads/
docs/tmp/

# ===== 本机解密 / 私有导出辅助文件 =====
image_key.json
scripts/exportIP*.mjs
scripts/batch_*_insights_data.json
scripts/missing*_overrides.json
scripts/tmp/
scripts/_test_*.png

# ===== 构建产物 =====
node_modules/
dist/
dist-ssr/
*.local

# ===== 日志 =====
logs/
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*

# ===== 编辑器 & 系统 =====
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# ===== Agent / AI 状态 =====
.claude/
.cursor/

# ===== 遗留文件 =====
README_CHATFILES.md

# ===== 杂项 =====
*.tsbuildinfo
*.zip
*.exe
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal

# ===== 密钥 / 环境变量（绝不入仓） =====
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.keystore
secrets.*

# ===== 个人身份覆盖（本机注入，见 .env.example） =====
# VITE_OWNER_WXID / VITE_OWNER_NAME / WECHAT_STORE / QQ_NUMBER 写在 .env.local
